ShaderNodeTexImage "Albedo": image albedo has no file path, its name is written
ShaderNodeTexImage "Roughness Image": image roughness has no file path, its name is written
ShaderNodeUVMap "UV Map": UV map "UVMap" read as the first UV set
ShaderNodeTexImage "Mirror Image": image emission has no file path, its name is written
ShaderNodeTexImage "Height Image": image height has no file path, its name is written
ShaderNodeTexImage "Height Image": projection BOX read as Flat
ShaderNodeTexImage "Normal Image": image normal has no file path, its name is written
ShaderNodeNormalMap "Normal Map World": WORLD space read as tangent space
ShaderNodeNormalMap "Normal Map Object": OBJECT space read as tangent space
